# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify response headers (copied to the site root by VitePress).
#
# The live demo boots wcvm, which needs a cross-origin isolated page (SharedArrayBuffer), so every page
# carries COOP + COEP. The site therefore must not load cross-origin subresources that lack CORS/CORP
# headers (fonts, scripts and images are all served from this origin).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
